  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["Torrey PI", "Torrey WI", "Torrey WI-W"],
    "description": "Non-automatic weighing instrument comprising the Torrey PI, WI and WI-W electronic weight indicators connected to a platform incorporating compatible OIML R60 load cell(s), forming a Class III self-indicating instrument. The WI-W version uses the same components as the WI, fitted with gaskets to make the indicator waterproof. Indicators have LCD display, operator keypad, plastic construction and four-wire load cell connection. Devices: subtractive tare, gross/net indication, semi-automatic tare, pre-set tare (PI only), battery indicator, unit indicator, AC/DC power supply indicator, motion indicator (PI only), semi-automatic zero-setting, zero-tracking, initial zero-setting. Protected interfaces: RJ-11 4-wire load cell connection, RS232 connection. Any compatible load cell with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity may be used, subject to the manufacturer's compatibility of modules calculation; load cells marked NH are allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted."
  },
